    "body": "This is used to tell GTK to redraw the render surface: https://docs.gtk.org/gtk4/method.Widget.queue_draw.html\r\n\r\n~~I do wonder if we can do this more intelligently... Maybe something like https://docs.gtk.org/gdk4/class.FrameClock.html could help the widget redraw itself autonomously. Let me look into this more~~\r\n\r\nThis is a bad idea as GTK does not like being redrawn hundreds of times a second. Gonna leave this as is.",
