    "body": "Minor nit: I think this is line-broken on main right now; possibly coming through drivers and not necessarily Ghostty, but it might help with readability, e.g.:\r\n\r\n```\r\nEGL API version 1.5 found\r\n - Vendor: NVIDIA\r\n - Version: 1.5\r\n - Device: /dev/dri...\r\n - Client APIs: OpenGL_ES OpenGL\r\n - Extensions:\r\n        ...\r\n```",
